/Title (Every seller lost to document confusion or silent rejection represents an acquisition cost already spent. For a marketplace whose entire edge is reaching first time and non technical sellers across Tier 2 and Tier 3 regions, the onboarding flow is the core product moat. Small and targeted interventions at these exact points of friction protect that value far more effectively than acquiring replacement sellers.)
/Dest [22 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 534 0 R
